@startuml
title Ticket Purchase - State Diagram

[*] --> Authentication : Authentication Request

Authentication : entry / Validate user info
Authentication --> SeatSelection : [user info valid]

SeatSelection --> SeatsSelected : Select seating place

state "Active reservation" as Reservation {
    [*] --> Booked

    state "Seats booked" as Booked
    state "Payment in progress" as Payment

    Booked --> Payment : Start payment
    Payment : entry / Redirect to Bank
}

Reservation : entry / Set timeout
Reservation : entry / Mark seats occupied

SeatsSelected --> Reservation : Book place(s)

state "Purchased" as Purchased
state "Reservation cancelled" as Cancelled

Payment --> Purchased : Bank confirms payment
Purchased : entry / Mark seats bought
Purchased : entry / Send confirmation email

Reservation --> Cancelled : after (15 min) / Cancel booking
Cancelled : entry / Mark seats available

Purchased --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]

@enduml